:'''Kafka:''' So... before you hear these words...
:'''Kafka:''' I don't want you to consider this a prophecy. You arrived at this moment because of the decisions you made.
:'''Silver Wolf:''' Hmm?
:'''Kafka:''' I don't know what you'll have endured... or whether you'll still believe in me. But if there's even a trace of doubt in your heart... I hope these words can give you strength...
